# Web3Forms access key (free: https://web3forms.com → enter the studio email → key arrives by mail).
# It is a public key by design (it can only send mail to the address it was created for),
# but keep it out of git anyway: put it in .env.local locally and in
# Cloudflare Pages → Settings → Environment variables for production builds.
NEXT_PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_KEY=
